{"id":1115941,"xmlId":"org.jetbrains.plugins.vue","name":"Vue.js","description":"<p>Provides <a href=\"https://vuejs.org/\">Vue.js</a> support to all JetBrains IDEs that\n    <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/products/#lang=js&amp;type=ide\">support JavaScript</a>.</p>\n\n    <h2>Features</h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Completion of components, directives, props, and methods in templates</li>\n      <li>Navigation from the component, directives, and event handlers to their definition</li>\n      <li>Coding assistance for different languages inside the template, script, and style tags in <code>.vue</code> files</li>\n      <li>Extract component and rename component refactorings</li>\n      <li>Collection of code snippets for Vue.js</li>\n      <li>New Vue project option in the <i>Welcome</i> screen</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>Getting started</h2>\n    <p>For information on getting started, head over to the <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/help/\">documentation</a> for your IDE.\n    For WebStorm, you can check out this section in the <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/help/webstorm/vue-js.html\">documentation</a>.</p>\n<h2>Getting started</h2>\n<p>Support includes:</p> \r\n<ul> \r\n <li>Code completion in the script, style and template blocks in .vue files (supported languages include: ES6, TypeScript, HTML, Pug, CSS, Sass, SCSS, Less).</li> \r\n <li>Support for the Vue template syntax.</li> \r\n</ul>","organization":"JetBrains s.r.o.","tags":["Framework"],"version":"262.9437.28","dependencies":["org.intellij.plugins.postcss","intellij.javascript.parser","intellij.css","JavaScript","intellij.javascript.psi.impl"],"optionalDependencies":["org.intellij.plugins.markdown","com.intellij.css","intellij.javascript.debugger.ui","intellij.json","intellij.javascript.common","intellij.javascript.ultimate","intellij.vuejs.common","intellij.platform.backend","intellij.vuejs.free","com.intellij.modules.ultimate","intellij.libraries.commons.text","intellij.postcss.paid","intellij.j